## 🚀 Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Salesforce DX CLI installed
- Salesforce Developer or Sandbox org
- Named Credential configured for your EHR endpoint

### Setup

```bash
# Clone the repo
git clone https://github.com/Nehanth0504/centene-care-connector.git
cd centene-care-connector

# Authenticate to your org
sf org login web --alias my-org

# Push source to org
sf project deploy start --target-org my-org

# Run all tests
sf apex run test --target-org my-org --code-coverage
```

---

## 💻 Core Classes

### `MemberEligibilityService.cls`
Handles real-time eligibility verification callouts to external payer systems. Implements retry logic, error handling, and audit logging.

### `CareConnectorCalloutService.cls`
Generic HTTP callout framework with Named Credentials, OAuth token refresh, and structured error responses.

### `PlatformEventPublisher.cls`
Publishes `MemberEligibilityEvent__e` platform events for async downstream processing via MuleSoft.

### `RetryQueueable.cls`
Exponential backoff retry pattern for failed integration callouts using Queueable Apex.

